  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> After a hostile creature lands an attack against an ally, the reactor invokes a demoralizing retort. External Reaction rerolls the successful attack and keeps the lower result. Use this only for features that can change an already-rolled attack.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
